
---

## 2️⃣ `.gitignore` — Python + Data + Notebooks

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# Virtual environment
venv/
.env

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.nbconvert.ipynb

# Data files (do NOT commit large or scraped data)
data/raw/*
data/cleaned/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/cleaned/.gitkeep

# Figures / outputs
figures/*
*.png
*.pdf

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Playwright
.playwright/

# data
.csv